  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This includes all the construction cost required for the construction of water supply schemes and water treatment facilities and the technical human resources required to deliver those construction work together with the cost required for water recharge ponds and various water use and optimisation measures including sanitation and hygiene facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
